    onUpdate; enroll/verify/revoke/regenerate are async seam methods. The view performs NO HTTP.
  Logic ports (executed XCTest):
    • TOTPCode.sanitize = web `value.replace(/\D/g,'').slice(0,6)` (ASCII-digit scalar filter, cap 6);
      TOTPCode.isComplete = web `code.length !== 6` guard (raw digit count, exact 6).
    • TOTPBackupCodesFile.contents = web `${header}\n\n${codes.join('\n')}\n`; filename verbatim.
    • TOTPVerifyErrorMapper = web handleVerify catch: TOTP_INVALID / TOTP_RATE_LIMITED /
      TOTP_ENROLLMENT_EXPIRED / generic(err.message ?? verifyGeneric) + codeLength short-circuit.
    • TOTPStatusProjection.resolvePhase = web render branches: isLoading → loading; mode==='open' or
      resolved-empty → openMode; session+!activated → notEnrolled; session+activated → activated;
      failed-no-cache → error(+retry, the QueryError-equivalent the web collapses into the notice);
      cached value persists behind loading/failed (content stays).
  Composition -> web GlassPanel section (header IconBox+title+subtitle+Badge pill; activated body
    last_used + backup_codes_remaining grid + Regenerate/Disable; not-enrolled body Enroll + hint) +
    Modal(enroll: QR <img> + manual secret + CopyButton + 6-digit Input + verify error + Cancel/Verify)
    + Modal(backupCodes: warning + codes grid + Download + Copy + Done) + ConfirmDialog(disable:
    requireTypedConfirmation="DISABLE"). All reproduced natively: TSGlassPanel x4, 3 sheet scaffolds,
    data-URI→platform-image QR (graceful glyph fallback), ShareLink download (platform-idiomatic blob
    equivalent), TSCopyButton, monospaced numeric field w/ .oneTimeCode autofill + numberPad (iOS).
  Shared components -> @/components/ui -> TSGlassPanel/TSButton/TSBadge(via tone)/TSIconBox/TSCode/
    TSCopyButton + typography tokens; @/components/feedback -> ProgressView spinner; @/components/motion
    -> TSFadeIn. Runtime-string pills/labels that the LocalizedStringKey-only TSBadge/TSTextField can't
    express use small token-mirroring views (TOTPStatusPill / TOTPCodeField), per the 0009 precedent.
    Recharts -> none / Leaflet -> none.
  States (all render) -> loading · openMode(empty notice) · notEnrolled · activated · error(+retry) ·
    stale(chip + one-shot auto-refresh) · offline(cached + chip). Plus the dialog sub-states: enroll
    modal, backup-codes modal, disable-confirm, and the inline verify-error sub-state. Each has a
